{"text":"The aftermath of 12 years was something I could not have foreseen. I definitely expected it to be an important film and a fantastic starting point for me in my professional career, but I never expected to receive all the recognition and accolades that came with it. As such, I had to make space in my heart to receive all the good stuff. And this was not easy. They don't teach you that at school. I had had a life of believing I was afraid of failure, and now here I was, faced squarely with the fear of success. I was afraid of success because I did not know what might lie on the other side of it. With success comes an added expectation, and with that comes lofty responsibility. Lately, I have been afraid of not being able to handle all these new expectations.","words":[{"text":"The","start":0.44,"end":0.8},{"text":"aftermath","start":0.8,"end":1.5},{"text":"of","start":1.5,"end":2.24},{"text":"12","start":2.24,"end":2.56},{"text":"years","start":2.56,"end":3.1},{"text":"was","start":3.52,"end":3.88},{"text":"something","start":3.88,"end":4.42},{"text":"I","start":4.42,"end":4.82},{"text":"could","start":4.82,"end":5.02},{"text":"not","start":5.02,"end":5.3},{"text":"have","start":5.3,"end":5.58},{"text":"foreseen","start":5.58,"end":6.32,"punct":"."},{"text":"I","start":7.92,"end":8.64},{"text":"definitely","start":8.64,"end":9.36},{"text":"expected","start":9.36,"end":9.98},{"text":"it","start":9.98,"end":10.22},{"text":"to","start":10.22,"end":10.36},{"text":"be","start":10.36,"end":10.56},{"text":"an","start":10.56,"end":10.74},{"text":"important","start":10.74,"end":11.2},{"text":"film","start":11.2,"end":11.7},{"text":"and","start":12.48,"end":12.84},{"text":"a","start":12.84,"end":13.0},{"text":"fantastic","start":13.0,"end":13.84},{"text":"starting","start":13.84,"end":14.88},{"text":"point","start":14.88,"end":15.22},{"text":"for","start":15.22,"end":15.64},{"text":"me","start":15.64,"end":15.88},{"text":"in","start":15.88,"end":16.08},{"text":"my","st